"inlineContent":[{"text":"A section that loads no items is removed from the page, together with whatever its ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"draws around the list, such as a title. So is a section that fails because no session or no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"profile is set: retrying cannot help until the host sets one, so the page offers no retry. Such","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a section comes back on its own once it has items to show. A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS\/UI\/SectionPage\/custom(id:content:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"child is never removed. When every section is removed and one of them has no session or no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"profile, the page shows a message in their place, still with no retry.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"With ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS\/UI\/SectionPage\/UIConfiguration\/isRefreshable"},{"text":", a pull loads every section again with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its provider’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"refresh()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Article and issue sections read the network; other providers can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"answer from their cache. A custom child has no provider, so the pull does not reach it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The set of sections is fixed for the page’s lifetime; each section’s content stays dynamic.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Passing a different set of ","type":"text"},{"code":"children","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (by ","type":"text"},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") rebuilds the page.","type":"text"}]}]}],"varia